  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "'## [13.3.6](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v13.3.5...v13.3.6) (2026-11-10)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **operator:** consume the timed entity queue without blocking a thread pool thread ([#1313](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1313)) ([0ee3b59](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/0ee3b59b913cd6461a47d8d1d53ed37ca1cd3ea6))\n* **operator:** only remove or promote the scheduled entry the timer read ([#1315](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1315)) ([359f401](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/359f4019caebb64730e3055090dbf60cbab14c2e)), closes [#1309](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1309)\n* **templates:** do not enable developer exception page outside development ([#1296](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1296)) ([112cd8c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/112cd8c783f437c7455c7a2687849d53e7c0bac7)), closes [#1295](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1295)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update dependency node to v26 ([#1294](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1294)) ([fe6c0a3](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/fe6c0a3c0fe9f724072204292e2a5c0fa708e9b3))\n* **ci:** update helm/kind-action action to v1.15.2 ([#1297](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1297)) ([090d25b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/090d25b589c281fa44e1aaafd86f88535cf8b725))\n* **core:** update dependency opentelemetry.instrumentation.http to 1.20.2 ([#1298](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1298)) ([3381136](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/3381136d090c80a92616fdfa8b14502175795f77))\n* **core:** update dependency stylecop.analyzers to 1.3.177-beta ([#1307](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1307)) ([2c13b68](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/2c13b6826ed0b4bf55bc784819b2cd2460786c61))\n* **test:** update xunit-dotnet monorepo ([#1317](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1317)) ([1203020](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/120302099e39f7a9422a85b2442f64581698d8cf))\n'",
